1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,140
(Howard:)I say we just take him
to Tatooine

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,100
(Howard:)and sell him to some Jawas.

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,770
(Raj:)That's two, dude.

4
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,520
(Raj:)Write your own jokes.

5
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:10,640
(Penny:)Oh, great.

6
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,310
(Penny:)Hi, I'm Penny,
I'll be your waitress.

7
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,950
(Leonard:)Why are you introducing
yourself?

8
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:17,120
(Penny:)I'd rather people not know

9
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,650
(Penny:)I have any prior connection
to you whatsoever.

10
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,820
(Sheldon-bot :)Can you tell me
the specials this evening?

11
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,320
(Penny:)Sheldon, I'm not waiting on you.

12
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:25,310
(Sheldon-bot:)Obviously.

13
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:27,530
(Sheldon-bot:)I don't even have
water yet.

14
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,080
(Penny:)Because you're not here.

15
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:32,550
(Sheldon-bot:)That's discrimination
against the otherwise located.

16
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:35,470
(Sheldon-bot:)I'm going to have
to go over your head.

17
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:41,290
(Sheldon-bot:)Manager... manager.

18
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:45,010
(Sheldon:)Oh, Lord,
look who it is.

19
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:48,180
(Howard:)Is that Steve Wozniak?

20
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,070
(Leonard:)I think it is.

21
00:00:49,070 --> 00:00:51,840
(Sheldon-bot :)The Great and Powerful Woz.

22
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:53,690
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)Penny,
Steve Wozniak was

23
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:54,650
(Leonard:)one of the cofounders

24
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:55,860
(Leonard:)of Apple Computer.

25
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:57,270
(Leonard:)He and Steve Jobs started it...
Yeah,

26
00:00:57,270 --> 00:01:00,020
I know who he is.
I watch Dancing with the Stars.

